    {
      "id": "claim_8cfb70b3999645b3b32eadba6877d0d9",
      "statement": "dsh-pet-panel's build is a four-step chain driven by the npm scripts `build`/`prepare` (`tsc -b && tsdown && node scripts/postbuild.mjs`): tsc -b type-checks and emits the lib/types tree, tsdown runs rolldown to emit lib/index.js and lib/client.js, and postbuild overwrites lib/index.js with lib/types/index.js.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L22-L27",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c1bf62b4560e90bc0a534eeb7543dd378224b1bdb17ccb630fecdcc7e022843e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tsconfig.json#L16-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f63022e5b83432ace02cc67d15e536bcbf6c34eea097b1a4a05cb0599ca89044:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e62e6abe213d4a6b9cf4eff1574d295c",
      "statement": "rolldown (via tsdown) does not lower Stage-3 @Remote decorators, so a raw rolldown lib/index.js keeps the decorator syntax verbatim and Node's ESM loader throws `SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token`; tsc does lower them to __esDecorate, and scripts/postbuild.mjs copies the tsc-emitted lib/types/index.js (same `export function apply` surface) over the rolldown output as the authoritative fix.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/index.js#L8-L8",
