      "id": "claim_03fa13c393c841bf82c88a26a76fdba4",
      "statement": "build/tsdown.client.ts exports clientBundle(id, libEntry, options), the shared single source of truth for the package build; it returns an ENV-selected tsdown config that emits the Node-side clientLibraryConfig plus a browser clientConfig when src/client/index.ts exists, and since a package-level tsdown.config.ts replaces the root workspace layout the lib half must be restated in the preset.",
