    {
      "id": "claim_a087d83229ef4c1a834f5d07a367e876",
      "statement": "The browser client bundle is a closure-factory artifact: the banner calls `window.__ModuleLoader__.load({ id, factory: (require) => {`, the intro seeds `var module = { exports: {} }; var exports = module.exports;`, and the footer closes with `return module.exports; } });`, resolving externals through the injected require backed by the loader's frozen module table.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://build/tsdown.client.ts#L331-L341",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:995b35eee9f2d50b3bfc7da9dbbc6e57764c62860aca0d40476c1ced57d93a95:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_421288b4e3504908acd85416acfd4c25",
      "statement": "PLATFORM_MODULES in build/web-platform.ts is the single shared list of frozen browser modules (react, react/jsx-runtime, react-dom, react-dom/client, @deepseek-ai/cordis, @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots, @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives) consumed by seeding, bundling externals, and Vite aliases so identities cannot drift, verified against the shell's 0.1.1-rc.2 dist set.",
      "evidence": [
