    {
      "id": "claim_a6b1df94b90b43be8ffec38fe0b04d6a",
      "statement": "CLIENT_EXTERNALS are `[...PLATFORM_MODULES, RUNTIME_STORE_EXEMPTION]`; the browser config's noExternal matcher inlines every specifier not in that list, because a require the module table cannot answer is a guaranteed runtime throw.",
