    {
      "id": "claim_5e2078a1d0064cf9b3c7a337cfd497c5",
      "statement": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime/client is a documented TEMPORARY runtime-store exemption (not a platform module, so absent from web-platform.ts) for the snapshot-store engine (createSnapshotStore/defineStore/shallowEqual) used by locale, ui-layout, and ui-conversation importers; at runtime the lazy CJS table answers it natively because runtime is an immediately-tier row registered before any dependent bundle materializes.",
