      "statement": "CSS Modules are compiled by lightningcss inside the bundle and auto-injected as a `<style data-plugin>` tag at factory execution; the module id is virtualized as `\\0dsh-css:<repo-relative-path>.mjs` to keep it out of tsdown's own css pipeline (whose guard matches ids ending in `.css`), and the stylesheet is re-registered as a rolldown watch dependency.",
