      "statement": "The built browser bundle differs from a plain inline: clientConfig emits `__DSH_PKG_VERSION__` from the package's package.json version so the anonymous install heartbeat can report the running release, and substitutes `process.env.NODE_ENV`, `import.meta.env.MODE`, and the bare `import.meta.env` key so node-idiom deps like zustand/immer do not throw ReferenceError at boot.",
